<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Beyond year net rises, 1-for-2 bonus.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Beyond year net rises, 1-for-2 bonus.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.54 vs 4.80</p>
<p>    Net					4.00 vs 3.35</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				   63.68 vs 42.01</p>
