<p>    Minorities			     0.02 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Beyond International Ltd is a film and television production company. The company said it would proceed with a one-for-two bonus issue of shares to shareholders registered by September 24, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
